  "excerpt": "After his multiple failures in his attempts to find and kill Krishna, Kansa sends his chief minister Akroora to Vrindavan to invite Krishna and Balarama to Mathura to participate in a Danur-Yagna accompanied with a wrestling competition with an intent to kill them in Mathura.\n\n\nAkroora was sent to Vrindavan, where he talked to Nanda and Yashodha about the Danur-Yagna function that was taking place in Mathura and that the king had asked Akroora to personally escort Krishna and Balarama to Mathura",
